===Adjective===
{{en-adj|more}}

# {{lb|en|usually|not comparable}} [[able|Able]] but not [[certain]] to happen; neither [[inevitable]] nor [[impossible]].
#: {{syn|en|futurable|Thesaurus:possible}}
